    {
      "id": "aecd2ff1-6729-43ab-8f70-dd58a4b4c916",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -3104,
        192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 864,
        "height": 624,
        "content": "## Inflation Impact Simulation Workflow\n\n\n## How it works:\nThis workflow automates the \"Financial Risk Assessment\" for 192 procurement categories. It fetches real-time inflation data (World Bank API), compares it against local historical spend and budget data, and uses AI (Groq/OpenAI) to generate impact reports for categories exceeding budget or inflation thresholds.\n\n## Setup Steps:\n\n1. Data Sources: Authenticate Google Sheets for historical_spend_data and category_budget_data.\n\n2. Logic: Ensure the Loop Over Items batch size is set to handle your row count.\n\n3. AI Agents: Provide API keys for Groq/OpenAI and verify the \"Pass Through\" settings.\n\n4. Output: Map the final spreadsheet columns to match your Dashboard headers."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "8d7bd840-b0d9-4642-8948-5049300609e1",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -2160,
        -48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1360,
        "height": 1040,
        "content": "## Data Ingestion & Normalization\n\nSection: Data Intake & Field Mapping\nFetches three distinct data sources: historical spend, budget limits, and live economic indicators. The Merge chain aligns these by category. The Edit Fields node maps raw data into standardized variables (spend, budget, inflation) for the calculation engine."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "0235b25f-2144-4912-aaa4-a1a459b3afa0",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -656,
        192
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1008,
        "height": 624,
        "content": "## The Simulation Engine (The Brain)\n\nSection: Risk Calculation Engine\nSequential JS logic:\n\n- Adjusts Spend: Applies inflation and FX conversion.\n- Variance Analysis: Compares adjusted spend against local budget.\n- Financial Impact: Weights the variance to estimate margin leakage and assigns a \"Safe\" vs. \"Critical\" status."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d4ac20fd-01ca-4a9e-8755-3df37e57ec0e",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        480,
        -48
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 1520,
        "height": 1040,
        "content": "## Intelligence & Multi-Channel Alerts\n\nSection: AI Logic & Reporting Loop\nRoutes data based on risk levels. AI Agents generate natural-language mitigation strategies. Results are written back to the Master Dashboard (Google Sheets) before sending personalized Gmail reports and urgent Slack alerts."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
